title: "[Decision tree] profile shapes" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q0: "One profile with maps\nin the outermost type?" {shape: diamond}
m0: "Manual: holds several profiles\n(nested-several-profiles)"
q1: "Generic, or nested\nin a generic type?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: is generic\n(generic)"
q2: "Partial?" {shape: diamond}
m2: "Manual: is partial\n(partial)"
q3: "One constructor?" {shape: diamond}
m3: "Manual: several constructors\n(several-constructors)"
q4: "Each statement / the arrow body\na CreateMap the rewrite handles?" {shape: diamond}
m4: "Manual: existing reasons\n(options, conversion, ...)"
q5: "Types public or internal?" {shape: diamond}
m5: "Manual: private or protected\n(nested-private-dto)"
q6: "MapFrom names accessible and\nthe same next to the outer type?" {shape: diamond}
m6: "Manual: private or protected /\nmeans something else\n(nested-private-member,\nnested-outer-member)"
q7: "<Outer><Profile>Extensions free?" {shape: diamond}
m7: "Manual: already exists\n(nested-name-taken)"
f0: "Fixed: empty constructor,\nextension class after the outer type\n(nested-profile, nested-record,\nnested-in-nested, expression-bodied*)"
q0 -> m0: no
q0 -> q1: yes
q1 -> m1: yes
q1 -> q2: no
q2 -> m2: yes
q2 -> q3: no
q3 -> m3: no
q3 -> q4: yes
q4 -> m4: no
q4 -> q5: yes
q5 -> m5: no
q5 -> q6: yes
q6 -> m6: no
q6 -> q7: yes
q7 -> m7: no
q7 -> f0: yes
